  "prefLabel": "Per 102.41 Family member",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.41 “Family member” means and includes the spouse, children, mother-in-law, father-in-law, parents, step-parents, step-children, step-brothers, step-sisters, grandparents, grandchildren, brothers, sisters, legal guardians, daughters-in-law, sons-in-law, and foster children of the employee.\n\nSource. #14434, eff 12-1-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/per100-1500.html"
